### Register a new user (sends verification email)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "1234567890",
  "fullName": "Test User"
}

### Verify email with 4-digit code
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "code": "1234"
}

### Resend verification code
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Login (should work even if email is not verified)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}
